<title>FINLAND: SUUNTO SEES FULL-YEAR 97 EARNINGS UP ON 96.</title>
<headline>SUUNTO SEES FULL-YEAR 97 EARNINGS UP ON 96.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish compass maker Suunto Oy said in a statement on Thursday it expected full-year 1997 earnings to improve on 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;As a whole, the group's net sales in 1997 will increase at the pace seen during the first four months, and the group's profitability is anticipated to improve,&quot; Suunto said.</p>
<p>In 1996, Suunto's profit after financial items was 12.6 million markka and net sales were 282.5 million.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
